    "detailed_description": "<i>Letters</i><br><br><i>Are</i><br><br><i>Falling</i><br><br><br><strong><i>MAKE WORDS FAST!</i></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Zim's Word Game!</h2><br><br>In this fast-paced word game, race against falling tiles while trying to score the most points possible. Watch out for fire, metal, and ice tiles! Use the special clearing tiles to annihilate a row or column. Quickly make use of the bonus point tiles before they disappear. Get into a state of word crafting zen with Zim's Word Game.<br><br><br>Will you go for a high score by building longer words? Perhaps you're looking to reach a new level by keeping the board as clear as possible. Figure out your play style and flex your vocabulary muscles in this fast paced word game.",
